B.ba4=new A.ks("Switch to a bigger model","Writing took only 5-10 s, and a bigger model can't use a fact that search never found.",!1)
B.ba0=new A.ks("Turn off the source list","Sources are how you check the answer; removing them saves almost nothing.",!1)
B.ba2=new A.ks("Put five hand-checked beginner notes in its instructions","The real fix. The key facts are now always in front of the model, whether search finds them or not.",!0)
B.a9H=s([B.ba4,B.ba0,B.ba2],t.Y0)
B.bbA=new A.D4("Now a 25-question test with hand-checked answers: score 0.80, median 74 s. It misses beginner basics because search often skips the short FAQ notes.",B.a9H,"Score 0.80 \u2192 0.91, median 74 s \u2192 65 s. (The test questions came from those notes, so it favours this change.)")
