B.axl=new A.a7('Why does "thinking first" help a model with a multi-step problem?',B.aov,2,"A model writes one token at a time; written-out steps become text it can build on, which is why chain-of-thought lifted PaLM 540B from 17.9% to 56.9% on math word problems.")
